WEBVTT

00:37:26.708 --> 00:37:30.518
AG: Did the father-in-law idea,
did that tug at your heartstrings at all?

00:37:30.542 --> 00:37:33.018
Employee: It did, yeah.
I'm married for seven years,

00:37:33.042 --> 00:37:34.768
so I think I connect to that, yeah.

00:37:34.792 --> 00:37:36.226
AG: I'm bummed.

00:37:36.250 --> 00:37:37.851
If we'd come on a different day,

00:37:37.875 --> 00:37:40.184
I could've done this
for our daughter's birthday.

00:37:40.208 --> 00:37:41.976
Would that have been more effective?

00:37:42.000 --> 00:37:45.934
Employee: I have a 15-month-old at home,
so that probably would've been equally as.

00:37:45.958 --> 00:37:49.559
We have too many connections here.
A daughter, a father-in-law and no hair.

00:37:49.583 --> 00:37:51.809
I think you kind of hit
all three marks there.

00:37:51.833 --> 00:37:53.292
(Upbeat music)